5788", "text": "| 11 | WorkOrderCandidate | REQUIRED_NOW_NONAUTHORITY | PIPD | HGK admission | candidate_only marker, never runtime authority |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-cba77bf809c37a842b13", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 12 | ECP | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD/ECP semantics | HGK/TQAEP | effect_intent, permission, retries, idempotency, readback, rollback |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-7223996a443ff6653331", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 13 | TQAEP | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD/TQAEP semantics | Independent checker/release | tests, oracles, fixtures, acceptance, requalification |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-29ae2290861d73d2c91a", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 14 | ExecutionHandoff | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | HGK/other receiver | receiver, abi_version, payload_refs, ack_nack_state |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-55448e9eb80a7c1b35cc", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 15 | EvidenceExpectation | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD/TQAEP | HGK/CI/provider | expected_evidence_type, producer, postcondition, freshness, claim_effect |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-641703f1b7dcf2b86ba6", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 16 | ClaimCeiling | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | all planes | allowed_claims, forbidden_escalation, close_conditions |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-214fc404f891737dd20d", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 17 | SurfaceProjectionManifest | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | surface compiler | surface, source_hashes, generated_files, parity_loss, stale_rule |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-dd24ef42efc3a1e81c45", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 18 | GENIEProjectionRef | SCHEMA_SEAM_ONLY_UNTIL_S6 | GENIE adapter | GENIE compiler | target refs ProductGraph/Profile/Bundle/GENIEArtifact"}, {"source_id": "SRC-4dab846db8d070beacc4", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "no truth writeback |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d73ab51e27e6265e385f", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 19 | ExecutionBindingRef | SCHEMA_SEAM_ONLY_UNTIL_S5 | HGK adapter | HGK | receiver binding id/version/hash/lease/state"}, {"source_id": "SRC-09d99faf531f3790e328", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "ACK only after HGK admission |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-8cf6d8328968ceb08fc4", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "## Hard invariants"}, {"source_id": "SRC-80dca4879718e0ec8b49", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- Every schema filename must exactly equal `<Contract>"}, {"source_id": "SRC-a00a083c0d73a1b481eb", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-a9ff6f811a2bfcdb19e2", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` with `PI-PKG` → `PI-PKG"}, {"source_id": "SRC-bd80115df2a04c17a28a", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-84e7b45eabba9c37f69c", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` and `PD-PKG` → `PD-PKG"}, {"source_id": "SRC-524af7bef3e802697d6d", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-86e4f38569112e942e31", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-13bfd57ec61f2d0c18e0", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- `registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-4603e1b1b3ad03b3ee65", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` must list all 19 in index order 01"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c9778829ceacba2a82ac", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "19 and must agree byte-for-byte with the schema files on `required_fields`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d3f1ca172cbc3fa9c51f", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- Do not invent a 20th family, do not rename a family, do not reorder"}, {"source_id": "SRC-df70555e715430a58c8a", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- Do not write anything outside `schemas/`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-29f870c17dc651bebd3d", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "## Single-source reconciliation (FW-02 / R-AUD-001)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-e72e7bfac332d52a02c2", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "**Single-source rule"}, {"source_id": "SRC-89b9caf2e13a9e3635f4", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "** Each `schemas/<Contract>"}, {"source_id": "SRC-4746069ea137b05368f8", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-f78625042824459c3425", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` is the *sole source of"}, {"source_id": "SRC-6ea3a5b4e8cc761cdd90", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "truth* for its own contract: its `required` array, its `$id`, and its `x-s0` metadata"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c767a547dd0a67b5f78b", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "block (`index`, `contract`, `materialization`, `owner`, `consumers`)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-cead2611fd891cdef8d8", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "The"}, {"source_id": "SRC-a65bf291f392f447452e", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`schemas/registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-1a7b76f031df3b5bcafc", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` file is a **derived view**: every family row"}, {"source_id": "SRC-fa40e9a91e9742b4029f", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "(`index`, `contract`, `materialization`, `owner`, `consumers`, `required_fields`,"}, {"source_id": "SRC-6dcdb130392ef8196a2e", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`schema_file`) is recomputed *from* the schemas, and for every family"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c760acee02158cd1209a", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-69d3fa8454ffeb719639", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "required_fields == schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-f307eeeec9c913621375", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "required` as exact sets (and as identical lists)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c521abae485fc6bd40c2", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "Hand-editing the registry is drift, never an input"}, {"source_id": "SRC-e2fb5140201ffbfa3a48", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "The §7"}, {"source_id": "SRC-399ca0f185f99c2d43d6", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "3 table above remains the"}, {"source_id": "SRC-5139559d315b90c4b50b", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "canonical floor: the exact 19/19 set, order, materialization, owner/consumer"}, {"source_id": "SRC-55501f655054ab82816b", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "metadata, and minimum required fields are checked against it"}, {"source_id": "SRC-61f6c6e1a9a60ee95aeb", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "**Version scheme"}, {"source_id": "SRC-aa61c52fd6616ffedf88", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "** Every schema carries exactly"}, {"source_id": "SRC-68f0c163853711d1a6dc", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`\"$id\": \"urn:pipd:s0:<Contract>:1\"` — one v1-consistent scheme for all 19 families"}, {"source_id": "SRC-e16541b26ff0ccd628e8", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "No family may carry a different version suffix in `$id` (the R-AUD-001 defect was"}, {"source_id": "SRC-097bc6bd96869eef8e1c", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`TechnologyAdmission` advertising `:2` while the S0 contract requires v1)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-97596b011c10027bf02e", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-e3576f1e794bfe909d77", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "evolution is expressed by tightening `required`/`properties` in place, not by"}, {"source_id": "SRC-43376f89f7a79ecd9dd6", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "version drift in the `$id`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-b82b00c81449ed3ecafb", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "**Enforcement"}, {"source_id": "SRC-7f6afcc1b0e01607b278", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "** `tools/registry_reconcile"}, {"source_id": "SRC-1f85389ed7873cdb8984", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "py` implements the rule:"}, {"source_id": "SRC-ce5411c6226d631124e7", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`--check` recomputes the registry from the schemas and fails (exit 1, offending"}, {"source_id": "SRC-2b5bce0ebb2ca2f56801", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "family and field/key named on stderr) on any drift"}, {"source_id": "SRC-f1c7ed8557de24cda5bf", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`--write` regenerates"}, {"source_id": "SRC-f2748653f9eccc0d8d50", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-0b062c7b331f4d7ee4d9", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` from the schemas"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c98ac44a5778006c4c13", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "Both modes refuse (a) a `required` field removal —"}, {"source_id": "SRC-1a015068426cad74310c", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "the registered set is a monotone ratchet: adding fields is tightening, deleting one"}, {"source_id": "SRC-620d70e7f6b092356520", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "is weakening and is never accepted — (b) an `$id` that breaks the `:1` scheme,"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d43859d213dca322f257", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "(c) owner/consumer/materialization metadata that diverges from the canonical §7"}, {"source_id": "SRC-659098fa05fac299bb3f", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "3"}, {"source_id": "SRC-76923a0fac1e7da91b0f", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c