634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 06 | PI-PKG | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | PD binder | stable semantic contract, trace, acceptance |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-a2f876148dba57d564ec", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 07 | PD-PKG | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | execution handoff | RepoContext, currentness, late_bound_construction_binding |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-596393dcf5409a406672", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 08 | TraceLink | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD/TQAEP | validators/checkers | from_type, from_id, from_hash, to_type, to_id, to_hash, rationale |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-ab21d8b391a2e4a1330f", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 09 | TaskSpecSeed | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | receiver adapter | goal, inputs, outputs, constraints, dependencies, tests, rollback, evidence |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-21324007b8078a340fc9", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 10 | ConstructionContract | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | HGK adapter | subject, writable_scope, expected_changes, tests, rollback, evidence_expectations |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-553a2b876880a49b440e", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 11 | WorkOrderCandidate | REQUIRED_NOW_NONAUTHORITY | PIPD | HGK admission | candidate_only marker, never runtime authority |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-15a390ef76883b0f7376", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 12 | ECP | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD/ECP semantics | HGK/TQAEP | effect_intent, permission, retries, idempotency, readback, rollback |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-bd7cf5e885dae82dc948", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 13 | TQAEP | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD/TQAEP semantics | Independent checker/release | tests, oracles, fixtures, acceptance, requalification |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-ca7acdb669417973a336", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 14 | ExecutionHandoff | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | HGK/other receiver | receiver, abi_version, payload_refs, ack_nack_state |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-1b47dd9dd2ac96c4b0f3", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 15 | EvidenceExpectation | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD/TQAEP | HGK/CI/provider | expected_evidence_type, producer, postcondition, freshness, claim_effect |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-6ffba9154e0c47fe1e1c", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 16 | ClaimCeiling | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | all planes | allowed_claims, forbidden_escalation, close_conditions |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d9751a553a8f4475de71", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 17 | SurfaceProjectionManifest | REQUIRED_NOW | PIPD | surface compiler | surface, source_hashes, generated_files, parity_loss, stale_rule |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-2e9b79f0fd17dd7aab82", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 18 | GENIEProjectionRef | SCHEMA_SEAM_ONLY_UNTIL_S6 | GENIE adapter | GENIE compiler | target refs ProductGraph/Profile/Bundle/GENIEArtifact"}, {"source_id": "SRC-0617438b949c2efaf2b5", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "no truth writeback |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-317e0ce2a238f37728f0", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "| 19 | ExecutionBindingRef | SCHEMA_SEAM_ONLY_UNTIL_S5 | HGK adapter | HGK | receiver binding id/version/hash/lease/state"}, {"source_id": "SRC-b97d190541d268613e75", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "ACK only after HGK admission |"}, {"source_id": "SRC-7bcb595228ff284b1039", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "## Hard invariants"}, {"source_id": "SRC-ec5240b3ab6aa47138d2", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- Every schema filename must exactly equal `<Contract>"}, {"source_id": "SRC-f5dbd51def6b16fc4f2a", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-b156b8ee145e379a0169", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` with `PI-PKG` → `PI-PKG"}, {"source_id": "SRC-b5e3d1ecc41975515035", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-449d50dd554c251789fc", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` and `PD-PKG` → `PD-PKG"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c9eed005020ab00da889", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-bb9f77cbadf20400f190", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-1207f0b0e4120321f645", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- `registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d9c23907668e59f7d3ae", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` must list all 19 in index order 01"}, {"source_id": "SRC-e6ff1484009e33ed00b8", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "19 and must agree byte-for-byte with the schema files on `required_fields`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-101dc0bafbf20e2b1289", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- Do not invent a 20th family, do not rename a family, do not reorder"}, {"source_id": "SRC-7eac722da4c05dfb194f", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "- Do not write anything outside `schemas/`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-41e5692b89c696dba883", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "## Single-source reconciliation (FW-02 / R-AUD-001)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d79115af490d379b9f73", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "**Single-source rule"}, {"source_id": "SRC-23b2b66e7e8fc6f9acb3", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "** Each `schemas/<Contract>"}, {"source_id": "SRC-5b05a6650527b4bfa0c1", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-8fe7604ec883c76d8e1c", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` is the *sole source of"}, {"source_id": "SRC-dd54404c76e4b72e45c1", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "truth* for its own contract: its `required` array, its `$id`, and its `x-s0` metadata"}, {"source_id": "SRC-9eec517235c040398335", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "block (`index`, `contract`, `materialization`, `owner`, `consumers`)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d9254d766012cc615d53", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "The"}, {"source_id": "SRC-76dc98b0d0d362e8ad44", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`schemas/registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-ee5362976949060ee6c3", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` file is a **derived view**: every family row"}, {"source_id": "SRC-5ec2635aeba62f61cbd2", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "(`index`, `contract`, `materialization`, `owner`, `consumers`, `required_fields`,"}, {"source_id": "SRC-482c1c227aed9437a103", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`schema_file`) is recomputed *from* the schemas, and for every family"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c77993c7681e11377723", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-b40b6ccaaebe7e910689", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "required_fields == schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-f6f4fccec967be8d0a56", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "required` as exact sets (and as identical lists)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-d5dab61a3ca4d34eefab", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "Hand-editing the registry is drift, never an input"}, {"source_id": "SRC-67b66f1c47c4d2e5644b", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "The §7"}, {"source_id": "SRC-bcc35374ffe13dbb64db", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "3 table above remains the"}, {"source_id": "SRC-fe05fbc53b191a700876", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "canonical floor: the exact 19/19 set, order, materialization, owner/consumer"}, {"source_id": "SRC-5c47dd139b999f29fe0c", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "metadata, and minimum required fields are checked against it"}, {"source_id": "SRC-9fe43690f2b799bd91da", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "**Version scheme"}, {"source_id": "SRC-35e686b1eb98b8bacdb1", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "** Every schema carries exactly"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c332f6336e19816425aa", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`\"$id\": \"urn:pipd:s0:<Contract>:1\"` — one v1-consistent scheme for all 19 families"}, {"source_id": "SRC-00886f25508d0e9b43c4", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "No family may carry a different version suffix in `$id` (the R-AUD-001 defect was"}, {"source_id": "SRC-71cbd58db12ae08ebd38", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`TechnologyAdmission` advertising `:2` while the S0 contract requires v1)"}, {"source_id": "SRC-a674051fbc51462740dd", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-2efdcd63b49ce7308916", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "evolution is expressed by tightening `required`/`properties` in place, not by"}, {"source_id": "SRC-97930acb98324f6dd815", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "version drift in the `$id`"}, {"source_id": "SRC-171190e928527950e9f6", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "**Enforcement"}, {"source_id": "SRC-3d9e57b5c6ad844d333a", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "** `tools/registry_reconcile"}, {"source_id": "SRC-370c42d6be37c6e95dc3", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "py` implements the rule:"}, {"source_id": "SRC-cd806ef45493c3b6c1cc", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`--check` recomputes the registry from the schemas and fails (exit 1, offending"}, {"source_id": "SRC-a5d6e98f4c7f93ca0c4c", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "family and field/key named on stderr) on any drift"}, {"source_id": "SRC-6dfe24138a513533a8c0", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`--write` regenerates"}, {"source_id": "SRC-702f44400d375a8a1690", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`registry"}, {"source_id": "SRC-ffd0fe27a54914e109f0", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` from the schemas"}, {"source_id": "SRC-e3fe690924b6e5861923", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "Both modes refuse (a) a `required` field removal —"}, {"source_id": "SRC-c7a8d62865f4723e1b84", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "the registered set is a monotone ratchet: adding fields is tightening, deleting one"}, {"source_id": "SRC-b39cef643c37bfc7f881", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "is weakening and is never accepted — (b) an `$id` that breaks the `:1` scheme,"}, {"source_id": "SRC-70dbfefbbb184f45d1ff", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "(c) owner/consumer/materialization metadata that diverges from the canonical §7"}, {"source_id": "SRC-7fa37bad431e208714d1", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "3"}, {"source_id": "SRC-0ec81029a90aeb8dbd66", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "table (seam-only families stay `SCHEMA_SEAM_ONLY_UNTIL_S5`/`_S6`), (d) any 20th"}, {"source_id": "SRC-4fcbdd14de030e593837", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "`*"}, {"source_id": "SRC-ccf4f0da817a18710859", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "schema"}, {"source_id": "SRC-e66f1af3812eb1119a11", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "text": "json` family, and (e) any loss of Draft 2020-12 /"}, {"source_id": "SRC-98ab03eabd17154d7606", "sha256": "dfd67710920aa9b04f68c5e46cfb1e15b58cf713d3c5634bc2276d1c61a35788", "te